{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Foretoken NVIDIA DCGM 加速器适配器提供的 GPU 基础硬件状态。缺少指标表示当前硬件或软件组合未报告，不能解释为数值 0。",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "当前至少报告温度、利用率或显存指标的 GPU 数量。按 Prometheus target、GPU index 和 UUID 去重。该数值仅表示 inventory，不代表 GPU 健康，也不判断数量是否符合预期。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "fixedColor": "blue",
            "mode": "fixed"
          },
          "noValue": "未采集",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "count(group by (instance, gpu, UUID) (DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_TEMP{foretoken_observability_source=\"accelerator\",foretoken_accelerator_vendor=\"nvidia\",foretoken_accelerator_exporter=\"dcgm\",instance=~\"${instance:regex}\",gpu=~\"${gpu:regex}\"} or DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL{foretoken_observability_source=\"accelerator\",foretoken_accelerator_vendor=\"nvidia\",foretoken_accelerator_exporter=\"dcgm\",instance=~\"${instance:regex}\",gpu=~\"${gpu:regex}\"} or DCGM_FI_DEV_FB_USED{foretoken_observability_source=\"accelerator\",foretoken_accelerator_vendor=\"nvidia\",foretoken_accelerator_exporter=\"dcgm\",instance=~\"${instance:regex}\",gpu=~\"${gpu:regex}\"}))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "GPU",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "已报告 GPU 数量",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "所有选中 DCGM Exporter target 都正常时为“正常”；任一 target 抓取失败即为“异常”。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "text": "异常"
                },
                "1": {
                  "color": "green",
                  "text": "正常"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "noValue": "未发现",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "min(up{foretoken_observability_source=\"accelerator\",foretoken_accelerator_vendor=\"nvidia\",foretoken_accelerator_exporter=\"dcgm\",instance=~\"${instance:regex}\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "状态",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "全部 DCGM targets 可抓取",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "所选 GPU 当前核心温度的最高值。70°C 和 85°C 颜色仅为通用可视化提示，不是告警阈值；请按 GPU 型号、机型散热和 NVIDIA 建议校准。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "noValue": "未采集",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 85
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "celsius"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
